== TABLE 7. the union bound: draws needed so that EVERY pattern of t bits on EVERY set of t of an operand's 64 positions
   is seen, with probability at least 1 - e^-3 = 0.95, by uniform draws: N >= 2^t (t ln 2 + ln C(64, t) + 3)
   one weekend item (div32-rne, as run): 14,498,660,352 draws
   t = 20  needs 5.702e+07 draws  (covered by a weekend item)
   t = 24  needs 1.002e+09 draws  (covered by a weekend item)
   t = 26  needs 4.158e+09 draws  (covered by a weekend item)
   t = 27  needs 8.455e+09 draws  (covered by a weekend item)
   t = 28  needs 1.717e+10 draws  (not covered by a weekend item)
   t = 29  needs 3.483e+10 draws  (not covered by a weekend item)
